# Generated media, never committed: `../make_fixtures.py` rebuilds it
# deterministically in about ten seconds, which is cheaper than carrying a few
# hundred kilobytes of MP4 in every clone.
#
# manifest.json IS committed — it is the ground truth, and it records the
# sha256/md5 of the media each measurement was proven against, so a stale
# fixture cannot be silently scored as a fresh one.
*.mp4
*.wav
